# M5: -916 828 -122 -> -853 828 -97: the generator's hop lands "through the
# seam's trigger into its switch box"; -916 is the trigger's centre (the
# Oct 16 walk this route was converted from switched there at once), but the
# c7 cook narrows t0a0b12's switch (eye) box to x -856..-824 (views of t0a0b1
# and t0a0b2 disagree west of it), and the old generator's current walk does
# the same: it walks from -916 828 -122 east through the trigger to
# -853 828 -97 (/scratch/quakegeneric/tmp/OldGreen3/gates/h32/hz/
# hl-walk-t0a0_.cfg, "closed seam, 13 hops"); this hop is that walk's last
# point. Both points touch the trigger_changelevel brush (x -1016..-816,
# y 824..832; GoldSrc fires on touch anywhere in it: HLSDK
# CChangeLevel::TouchChangeLevel), so the GoldSrc behaviour is the same; at
# -916 the seam only switched as forced after 1 s.
setpos -853 828 -97 0 0
